Subject: [PATCH] Snapshots of the deforum COMP, input video loop as COMP
 output 3, Reload Render + Input

- Pipeline: Take Snapshot / Snapshot File / Load Snapshot (every parameter with expressions and binds, prompt_seq, preset state; T:/snapshots)
- in_head/in_tail -> in_cross -> out_input: the init video at render size, frame-matched and seam-crossfaded like the render
- Pipeline > Reload Render + Input reloads outputs 1 and 3

